# Operator Schedule

This schedule is checked by {{OPERATOR_NAME}} on every heartbeat. The Codex automation wakes {{OPERATOR_NAME}} every {{OPERATOR_CADENCE_MINUTES}} minutes after activation; this file decides what {{OPERATOR_NAME}} does when awake.

Run history lives in [[Operations/OPERATOR_LOG.md]].

## Rules

- Support missed-run recovery. If the laptop slept, run each missed scheduled task once unless the task says otherwise.
- Do not duplicate existing specialist watchers unless {{COS_NAME}} intentionally migrates them here.
- Keep task-specific behavior in skills or clear instructions, not in the heartbeat prompt.
- Notify only when the scheduled task finds a material result, is blocked, or needs {{USER_NAME}}/{{COS_NAME}}.
- Log every attempted scheduled task.

