## Template

```yaml
### schedule_id
- status: active
- cadence: every_1_hour | every_15_minutes | once_per_day_after_time
- target_time: HH:MM
- catch_up: yes/no
- mode: autonomous | assisted
- desired_output: execute | prepare_draft | prepare_packet | verify | prompt_specialist | monitor | preserve_evidence
- risk: low | medium | high
- instructions: concrete task instruction
- allowed_actions: what Operator may do without asking
- stop_conditions: when Operator must stop and ask/log
- proof_required: screenshot, file path, URL, draft link, or summary
```
